nity compensation from 0.0 to 50.0 ppt", "Large, bright backlit display for easy reading", "Small footprint saves bench space", "500-point data log, exported to a computer or printer", "Non-volatile memory keeps settings and data if the power fails", "On-screen stability icons", "Automatic or manual temperature compensation; one-point ATC probe offset calibration", "Meter-attached electrode stand", "Data and calibration logs are date and time stamped for GLP/GMP"]', 'environmental-equipment', '/products/eutech/1730-kit.jpg'),
